# spec 05a T1 `a2a data pack`: a pinned <XC-id>@<version> that this space
# never published is refused LOCALLY (internal/space's own
# ErrContractNotPublished, surfaced by ResolveDataContractSchemas reading
# the mirror's own committed contract-history file) — pack is write-free
# by design (its own synopsis: "write-free") and this wave's own policy
# (cmd/a2a/wire.go's resolveDataDeps) does not sync the mirror or resolve a
# credential for it, so the refusal is exec-able against this local
# fixture without ever reaching a GitHub host, matching submit_refusal.txtar
# in this same directory.
mkdir srcdir
! exec a2a data pack --contract XC-axon-widget@1.0.0 --from srcdir --profile synthetic --format json
stderr 'contract version is not published'
